<title>USA: National Record Dec same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>National Record Dec same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Record Mart Inc said Thursday same-store sales for the month of December rose four percent over December 1995 for stores opened at least one year, while total sales rose 3.6 percent for all stores.</p>
<p>The company said same-store sales for stores opened at least a year rose six percent for the quarter ending December 28, and total sales were up 6.2 percent from $33.8 million to $35.9 million.</p>
</text>
